    TODO-0001: fill in what large does to a drink
    
    Each add-on is a case in two switches: one in priceOf() and one in
    describe(). So filling in large meant two edits in two methods, and
    neither is like the others: extra shot and whip add to the end of the
    price and description, while large multiplies the price and goes in
    front of the name.
    
    Everything an add-on does is split between those two switches, and
    CoffeeCart, which should only keep track of an order, holds the rules
    for every add-on.

